[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+### game/engine/audio.py — complete rewrite[0m
[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+- `Audio.play(name, pos=None)`: inverse-square distance attenuation (_MIN_RANGE=32px → _MAX_RANGE=512px). `pos` is a `(tx, ty)` tile position; volume scales by 1/(1 + (dist - min)^2 * rolloff).[0m
[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+- `Audio.set_biome(biome_id)`: switches the looping ambience track per biome. Catacombs → `music_catacombs_drip`, Ember → `music_ember_warrens`, Drowned → `music_drowned_vaults`.[0m
[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+- `Audio.play_title_theme()`: plays the title theme once. Called from `MenuScene.draw()`.[0m
[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+- `Audio.play_door(pos=None)`: door-creak SFX with distance attenuation. Wired into `_unlock_doors()` in `world.py`.[0m
[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+- `Audio.play_stairs(pos=None)`: stairs SFX with distance attenuation. Replaces `play(self, "stairs")` in both `_check_exit()` methods in `world.py`.[0m
[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+- `save_wave_state(path)` / `load_wave_state(path)`: persist/restor audio state.[0m
[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+- Graceful degradation preserved: `Audio(enabled=False)` → `ok=False`, all play calls return silently.[0m
[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+[0m
[38;2;255;255;255;48;2;19;87;20m+### game/data/biomes.json — audio fields added[0m
